. But concerns: regarded as pretentious, sometimes adopts wrong tone. So reliability and stress resilience strong, but communication concerns.\n\nCandidate A: quick correct decisions, excellent attention, puts concern for others above everything, but difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, not willing to further education. So decision quality good, but communication and development concerns.\n\nCandidate C: anticipates dangerous situations, sees complex connections, excellent spatial vision, very good leadership, but unfriendly, eats unhealthily. So technical competence and leadership strong, but crew cooperation concerns.\n\nCandidate D: responds to unexpected events adequately, concentrates well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously, but moody, loner. So reliability, problem solving, responsibility good, but cooperation concerns.\n\nWe need to start discussion. Perhaps start by highlighting Candidate C's strong technical competence and leadership, but note concerns about unfriendly behavior affecting crew cooperation. Vote maybe for Candidate C but with reservations? Or we could propose Candidate B as leading due to stress handling and conscientiousness, but communication concerns.\n\nWe need to state vote. Let's pick Candidate B as current recommendation, because stress resilience and conscientiousness are critical for long-distance flights, and technical competence (weather assessment, computer skills) is good. Communication concerns are noted but may be mitigated.\n\nThus: vote Candidate B.\n\nProvide evidence: B is very conscientious, handles stress well, good at assessing weather, excellent computer skills. Concern: pretentious, wrong tone.\n\nExplain implication: overall fit strong, but need to address communication.\n\nThus public message.\n\nAlso update shared mental model? Not needed.\n\nProceed."}
